\begin_layout Section
Alternative covariates
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The models from the previous section rely solely on census derived data.
 Microdata in the case of CensusEB estimates, and on PSU and municipality
 level aggregates in the case of unit-context and XGboost estimates.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Introduce objective: To understand how different covariate specifications
 affect performance
\end_layout

